Description: With no camera chosen in Kamoso, use the camera the session names as its default
 Kamoso took the first camera of GStreamer's device list and then the camera saved at its last exit,
 which Kamoso wrote on every exit, chosen or not. It never read PipeWire's default video source, so
 the Camera page of System Settings (sparky-stereo-camera) had no effect on it. Now a camera the
 person picks in Kamoso's own list stays theirs (kamosorc, DeviceChosen); otherwise the camera
 named by default.video.source in PipeWire's "default" metadata is used, then the first as before.
Author: Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, written for Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 570); upstream search 2026-11-15: no merged or open change for this (open MR 62 "Remember the chosen camera across restarts and add a camera switcher" is related and not carried)
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
